#. module: delivery_status_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_status_tracking.field_delivery_carrier__delivery_simulation
msgid ""
"For demos and training only: nothing is sent to the carrier. When a delivery"
" is validated it gets a fictitious tracking number, and each status update "
"moves it forward (recorded, in transit, delivered). Carrier integrations "
"that support it (e.g. Sendcloud) simulate their own API instead. Never "
"enable it in production."
